<title>JAPAN: Daiei 96/97 unrealised securities loss Y214.6 bln.</title>
<headline>Daiei 96/97 unrealised securities loss Y214.6 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiei Inc said on Friday that unrealised losses on its securities holdings totalled 214.6 billion yen as of February 28, the end of its business year.  </p>
<p>Daiei, Japan's largest supermarket operator, on Tuesday revised downward its forecast of parent current profit for fiscal 1996/97 to 500 million yen from a previous forecast of 13 billion yen.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the downward revision was due to sluggish sales, especially of winter apparel.</p>
</text>
